  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 3777 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E4", "D1"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Corvale General has 256 units on hand at 15.6 units per day, providing 16 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label identifies Northwind Health Company, LLC as the registered plant (FEI 1831143) with a VAI inspection on 2025-09-26.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 952157 classified the same facility (FEI 1831143, Northwind Pharmaceuticals LLC) as OAI with an end date of 2015-12-09.",
      "cites": ["E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 3777 days before the posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E4", "D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections in 2018 and 2025 returned VAI classifications.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended alternative is Proficient Rx LP, which is not on FDA's shortage list and whose plant last received a VAI inspection on 2022-12-08.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    }
  ]
}
